<<^ code="&#x0002;">>

! Archive

<<~ ahu #/definition>>

!! Definition

Storing to and retrieving from a noospheric record — the handshake that asks an archive for what it holds, or commits something to it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/activation>>

!! Activation

Opens a channel to a stored corpus: query it, deposit into it, or authenticate against it. Standing and permissions may gate the read (relay-law: pull does not imply read).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/interaction>>

!! Interaction

Pairs with `function/magic-decode` (decode then fetch meaning) and `domain/divination`. A hostile archive may read the reader — surfacing an owner-trace.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/filters>>

!! Filters

```text
[tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/function/archive]]               all archive modules
[tag[prefix[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/function/]]]              all function components
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/aftermath>>

!! Aftermath

* Archive permissions map onto the ability ladder (`pull → read → write`). Confirm whether that belongs here or in a capability component.

<<~/ahu>>

